{"id":"560f3803f7afc6b7","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class.md","title":"ZFC Ord Closed Unbounded Class","display":"df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class — ZFC Ord Closed Unbounded Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class"],"display":"df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class — ZFC Ord Closed Unbounded Class","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class — ZFC Ord Closed Unbounded Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> (ordinal-class candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedUnboundedClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedUnboundedClass}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedUnboundedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in C\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta))\\land\\forall D\\in V\\;\\bigl(D\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq C\\to\\sup D\\in C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedUnboundedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in C\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta))\\land\\forall D\\in V\\;\\bigl(D\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq C\\to\\sup D\\in C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure ranges over set-sized nonempty subclasses, while unboundedness ranges over every ordinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (class predicate, see [[58-df-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedUnboundedClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedUnboundedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in C\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha<\\beta))\\land\\forall D\\in V\\;\\bigl(D\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq C\\to\\sup D\\in C\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1115,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2843","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class.md|58-df-zfc-ord-closed-unbounded-class]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}